      "id": "fae3320f-0486-4efe-bb2c-a00dd51fd743",
      "name": "host",
      "description": {
        "content": "Create or Delete a host inside the vault or the group",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "7549cd5f-18ec-4ca0-a3bc-407089b839d6",
          "name": "Create a new Host in the vault",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create a new Host in the vault",
            "description": {
              "content": "Pass the host ID in your infrastructure as `external_id` in the API\npath, the vault name in the `vault`, `address`, and optional `label`\nfields. Additionally, pass the ssh port in `port` field inside the\n`ssh` object or telnet port in `port` inside the `telnet` object.\n\nTo see the full schema of the request, click on the **Schema** in\n**Request body** below.\n\nExample of the request that creates a new host with `external_id` as\n`vm-1234` in `Team` vault with address `example.com`, label `Database`,\nssh port `22`, and ssh credentials in `username` and `password`\nproperties, and SSH key in the `key` property:\n\n- path: `/v1/host/vm-1234/`\n- body:\n  ```\n  {\n    \"vault\": \"Team\",\n    \"address\": \"example.com\",\n    \"label\": \"Database\",\n    \"ssh\": {\n      \"port\": 22,\n      \"credentials\": {\n        \"username\": \"username\",\n        \"password\": \"password\",\n        \"key\": {\n          \"label\": \"shared with the team\",\n          \"private\": \"-----BEGIN OPENSSH PRIVATE KEY-----\\nb3Blbn...\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  ```\n\nOptionally, pass the `group` field with the group `external_id` instead\nof the vault. Create such a group with the\n<a rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"#operations-group-createGroup\">\n<code>/group/{external_id}/</code> API</a>.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "host",
                ":external_id",
                ""
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "external_id",
                  "description": "(Required) Host ID in your original system"
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"address\": \"<string>\",\n  \"group\": \"<string>\",\n  \"vault\": \"<string>\",\n  \"label\": \"<string>\",\n  \"tags\": [\n    \"<string>\",\n    \"<string>\"\n  ],\n  \"ssh\": {\n    \"port\": 22,\n    \"credentials\": {\n      \"key\": {\n        \"label\": \"<string>\",\n        \"private\": \"<string>\",\n        \"public\": \"<string>\"\n      },\n      \"username\": \"<string>\",\n      \"password\": \"<string>\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"telnet\": {\n    \"port\": 22,\n    \"credentials\": {\n      \"username\": \"<string>\",\n      \"password\": \"<string>\"\n    }\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
